Package: linux-wallpaperengine-kylin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aniuzhong <101186392+aniuzhong@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libglew2.1, libglfw3, libmpv1, libavcodec58, libavformat58, libavutil56, libswresample3, libsdl2-2.0-0, liblz4-1, libpulse0
Description: Wallpaper Engine wallpapers on Kylin V10 SP1 (linux-wallpaperengine)
 Repackaging of linux-wallpaperengine for Kylin V10 SP1 with UKUI desktop
 integration: renders Steam Workshop wallpapers as the desktop background.
 Includes the peony interposition shim for transparent desktop icon support.
 The engine binary and libraries install under /opt/linux-wallpaperengine.
